    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever tried rowing a barrel down a river? It's harder than it looks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Row Away</i>, you\u2019ll paddle your way through winding and rocky rivers, and sudden currents\u2014all from inside a floating barrel. It\u2019s part chill river adventure, part test of patience and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you\u2019re soaking in the calm sounds of nature. The next, you\u2019re bouncing off a boulder and spinning helplessly downstream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a <i>\u201cchill\u201d</i> river adventure with occasional moments of rage\u2014or maybe frequent ones. It all depends on your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your journey with simple character customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.poster.avif?t=1755694125\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.webm?t=1755694125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.mp4?t=1755694125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Row through a variety of hand-crafted river terrains</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill, nature-inspired sound design and visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls: <i>left-click to row, move your mouse to rotate</i>\u2014it\u2019s harder than it sounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints, no hand-holding\u2014just you and the river.\u00a0But don\u2019t worry: your progress is saved when you quit the game, whether manually or forcefully (alt+F4)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the end\u2026 if you can</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So grab your paddle, hop in your barrel, and <i>Row Away</i>.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever tried rowing a barrel down a river? It's harder than it looks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Row Away</i>, you\u2019ll paddle your way through winding and rocky rivers, and sudden currents\u2014all from inside a floating barrel. It\u2019s part chill river adventure, part test of patience and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you\u2019re soaking in the calm sounds of nature. The next, you\u2019re bouncing off a boulder and spinning helplessly downstream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a <i>\u201cchill\u201d</i> river adventure with occasional moments of rage\u2014or maybe frequent ones. It all depends on your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your journey with simple character customization </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.poster.avif?t=1755694125\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.webm?t=1755694125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/23dddec1a84cd14d639b80743db8f60a.mp4?t=1755694125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Row through a variety of hand-crafted river terrains</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill, nature-inspired sound design and visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls: <i>left-click to row, move your mouse to rotate</i>\u2014it\u2019s harder than it sounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints, no hand-holding\u2014just you and the river.\u00a0But don\u2019t worry: your progress is saved when you quit the game, whether manually or forcefully (alt+F4)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the end\u2026 if you can</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So grab your paddle, hop in your barrel, and <i>Row Away</i>.</strong></p>",
